                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I'm only two hours into this game, but it's currently scratching the \"No Man's Sky\" itch better than No Man's Sky in some ways - mostly by virtue of having a narrative and non-random upgrades.  It's very much a low-polygon game, and lacks NMS' impressive space-to-surface mechanics (and most of the other features, like base-building and your own customisable vehicles), but its gameplay loop is actually more satisfying.  Also, it's a fraction of the size on disk.",
